 native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"abstract":[{"text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" patch, which wires its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"output ","type":"text"},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"card snaps back to its resting position.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","role":"symbol"}}}